// CROWN — `with Pure` over a parameter's row is the empty closed cap on
// that cell: a performing callback violates it at the argument edge.
// Accepted by boot 2974547b (the same vacuous class as leak-gate-vacuous).
// Expect E_EffectMismatch.
effect E { op() -> Int }
handler h { op() => resume(7) }
fn run(f) with Pure = f()
fn main() = (run(() => op())) ~> h
